<title>USA: Dow lower at start.</title>
<headline>Dow lower at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials took their cue from a weak bond market at the start of trading Monday and moved lower.</p>
<p>--Dow Industrials  off 11 at 6728.</p>
<p>--Nasdaq Composite  up two at 1212</p>
<p>--S&amp;P Index  off fractionally at 765.</p>
<p>--NYSE advance/decline  192/244</p>
<p>--Nasdaq advance/decline  547/631</p>
<p>--The 30-year long bond off 3/32 to yield 7.15 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1737</p>
</text>
